>speech_prog P How do i use these lockpicks?~
if quest (0,3,$n)==2
 say If you run a small errand for me, I will show you.  Will you help me?
endif
~
>speech_prog yes~
if quest (0,3,$n)==2
 say Good, I need you to go to the the Village Clothier 
 say and tell Dee "Bob needs a new set of boots."
 say she will probably give you some boots for me,
 say when she does come back here and give them to me please.
 mpmset $n quest 0 3 3
endif
~
>give_prog iQQ09~
if quest (0,3,$n)==4
 mpjunk QQ09
 say Thanks, let me see your lock picks.
 emote holds his hand out waiting to see your lock picks.
endif
~
>give_prog iQQ08~
if quest (0,3,$n)==4
 say These picks seem to be broken.  Here is a new set. 
 say All you have to do is make this piece ENTERLOCK, and TURNIT.
 mpjunk QQ08
 mpoload QQ10
 give iQQ10 $n
 say Don't let the Mayor see these. He gets real angry about stuff like this in his township.
 mpmset $n quest 0 3 5
endif
~
