P 3
TRIG_VOID
OPROG_ECHO
You put the lockpicks in the lock just right, now you have to turnit.~
P 3
TRIG_VOID
OPROG_GOD_COMMAND
Mpmset $ questr QQ00 0 3 6~
P 4
TRIG_VOID
OPROG_ECHO
You must have put the lockpicks in slightly wrong, they don't fit.~
P 5
TRIG_UNKNOWN 100 turnit
OPROG_IF OIF_USER_ROOM_NUM = QQ51 6 8
P 6
TRIG_VOID
OPROG_PLAYER_QUEST_IF 0 3 = 6 7 8
P 7 
TRIG_VOID
